{"id":"vskore","lemma":"вскоре","pos":"adv","rank":1283,"glosses":["soon","before long"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/a/a1/Ru-%D0%B2%D1%81%D0%BA%D0%BE%D1%80%D0%B5.ogg/Ru-%D0%B2%D1%81%D0%BA%D0%BE%D1%80%D0%B5.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Она вскоре будет здесь.","en":"She will be here before long.","words":[{"g":"she / it"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"быть"},{"g":"here"}]},{"text":"Мы ушли вскоре после этого.","en":"We left soon after that.","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"to leave","l":"уйти"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[3,5,"afterwards, thereafter"]]},{"text":"Вскоре он ушёл.","en":"He soon walked away.","words":[null,{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to leave","l":"уйти"}]},{"text":"Они вскоре стали друзьями.","en":"They soon became friends.","words":[{"g":"they"},null,{"g":"steel","l":"сталь"},{"g":"close friend","l":"друг"}]},{"text":"Я вскоре уснул.","en":"I soon fell asleep.","words":[{"g":"I"},null,{"g":"to fall asleep","l":"уснуть"}]}]}